    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "D08478C5B12C054C",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "D0847BC5B12C0A65",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "D0847AC5B12C08B2",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "26EA43CD4C95C76E",
      "text": "阁下疯了吗！？只有１只\\n宝可梦可不能进行交换！\\c\\n想交换的话，至少要\\n有２只同行宝可梦！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "26EA44CD4C95C921",
      "text": "宝可梦交换乃是生命的交易，\\n阁下就好好深思熟虑吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "71927D95957453C5",
      "text": "阁下果然还是\\n想交换宝可梦吧？[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "B7391A7E53993839",
      "text": "离上课还有些时间，阁下要\\n和我共同创作名为对战的艺术吗？[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "6A2CFDDEDDA86E6A",
      "text": "要是没兴致的话就算了，\\n我不会逼阁下的。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "ABAAB20995052AC0",
      "text": "好！让我们充满艺术性地\\n到外面去吧！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battlestart_01",
      "hash64": "ABAAB30995052C73",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
